5,1,1,talk,May,,I'll start by digging into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. Let's see if we're just repeating old mistakes!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract. It would be a pity to design a masterpiece that no one is available to operate.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I will look into the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, as well as the journey audits on where minutes go. I want to understand where the real delays are happening.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I think it would be wise to see what the ground might hide and who must give their approval. I shall look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I will examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates. I want to understand the long-term financial commitments we are making.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
